INSERT INTO "chat_messages" ("id", "app_id", "conversation_id", "content", "is_user_message", "created_at", "created_by", "updated_at", "updated_by") VALUES (1847120440305258496, 1798176607609950208, 'gMjT9UhvOGrghN8f5ibgs', '- 以下是计算两个向量余弦值的 Python 程序：

```python
import numpy as np

def cosine_similarity(vector1, vector2):
    dot_product = np.dot(vector1, vector2)
    norm_vector1 = np.linalg.norm(vector1)
    norm_vector2 = np.linalg.norm(vector2)
    return dot_product / (norm_vector1 * norm_vector2)

# 示例使用
vector1 = [1, 2, 3]
vector2 = [4, 5, 6]
print(''余弦相似度:'', cosine_similarity(vector1, vector2))
```

运行这个程序将会输出两个向量的余弦相似度。例如，对于向量 `[1, 2, 3]` 和 `[4, 5, 6]`，程序将输出 `0.9746318461970762`。', 'f', '2024-10-18 11:40:05.464458', 'admin', '2024-10-18 11:40:05.464458', 'admin');
