INSERT INTO "chat_messages" ("id", "app_id", "conversation_id", "content", "is_user_message", "created_at", "created_by", "updated_at", "updated_by") VALUES (1861973513691336704, 1798176607609950208, '0iQvv4vg_ptsB9f7ol-h2', '许嵩，1986年5月14日出生于安徽省合肥市，毕业于安徽医科大学，是中国内地流行乐男歌手、词曲作者、编曲、音乐人，现任海蝶音乐公司（现为太合音乐集团）音乐总监。他的代表作品包括《素颜》、《有何不可》、《如果当时》、《多余的解释》、《玫瑰花的葬礼》、《清明雨上》、《幻听》、《庐州月》等。许嵩以其情深款款的嗓音和隽永秀美的歌词赢得了众多粉丝的喜爱，被誉为一代人的青春回忆。', 'f', '2024-11-28 11:20:54.116238', 'qinyuanpei', '2024-11-28 11:20:54.116238', 'qinyuanpei');
INSERT INTO "chat_messages" ("id", "app_id", "conversation_id", "content", "is_user_message", "created_at", "created_by", "updated_at", "updated_by") VALUES (1861977010176397312, 1798176607609950208, '0iQvv4vg_ptsB9f7ol-h2', '使用 Serp 搜索 樊振东当红不让', 't', '2024-11-28 11:34:47.743256', 'qinyuanpei', '2024-11-28 11:34:47.743256', 'qinyuanpei');
INSERT INTO "chat_messages" ("id", "app_id", "conversation_id", "content", "is_user_message", "created_at", "created_by", "updated_at", "updated_by") VALUES (1861977401748230144, 1798176607609950208, 'WvLsTmP-gXkwAEeilJQzi', '帮我搜索一下朝韩冲突最新的报道', 't', '2024-11-28 11:36:21.101625', 'qinyuanpei', '2024-11-28 11:36:21.101625', 'qinyuanpei');
INSERT INTO "chat_messages" ("id", "app_id", "conversation_id", "content", "is_user_message", "created_at", "created_by", "updated_at", "updated_by") VALUES (1861977603007713280, 1798176607609950208, 'WvLsTmP-gXkwAEeilJQzi', '最新的朝韩冲突报道主要集中在以下几个方面：

1. **韩乌情报分享**：韩国和乌克兰同意分享有关朝鲜和俄罗斯的情报，但韩国民意不支持向乌克兰提供武器。
2. **朝鲜向乌克兰派遣士兵**：朝鲜出兵帮助俄罗斯，这被认为可能危及中国的平衡做法。
3. **军事演习**：韩国称俄罗斯向朝鲜提供防空导弹以换取其派兵支持作战。
4. **朝鲜炮击韩国延坪岛**：朝鲜向韩国延坪岛附近发射炮弹，导致建筑起火和人员受伤。
5. **朝鲜半岛局势紧张**：朝鲜半岛局势持续紧张，各方都在进行军事准备和演习。

这些报道反映了当前朝鲜半岛局势的复杂性和紧张程度。', 'f', '2024-11-28 11:37:09.085497', 'qinyuanpei', '2024-11-28 11:37:09.085497', 'qinyuanpei');
INSERT INTO "chat_messages" ("id", "app_id", "conversation_id", "content", "is_user_message", "created_at", "created_by", "updated_at", "updated_by") VALUES (1861694919521996800, 1798176607609950208, '0iQvv4vg_ptsB9f7ol-h2', '生成的表单页面如下：

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>事故上报表单</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.7.1/dist/leaflet.css" />
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 20px;
        }
        #map {
            height: 300px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }
        form {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
        }
        label {
            margin-top: 10px;
        }
        input, textarea {
            margin-top: 5px;
            padding: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
        button {
            margin-top: 20px;
            padding: 10px;
            background-color: #007BFF;
            color: white;
            border: none;
            border-radius: 4px;
            cursor: pointer;
        }
        button:hover {
            background-color: #0056b3;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div id="map"></div>
    <form id="accidentForm">
        <label for="location">事故发生位置 (经纬度):</label>
        <input type="text" id="location" name="location" readonly>
        
        <label for="type">事故类型:</label>
        <input type="text" id="type" name="type" required>
        
        <label for="time">事故发生时间:</label>
        <input type="datetime-local" id="time" name="time" required>
        
        <label for="details">事故详情:</label>
        <textarea id="details" name="details" rows="4" required></textarea>
        
        <label for="reporter">事故上报人:</label>
        <input type="text" id="reporter" name="reporter" required>
        
        <button type="submit">提交</button>
    </form>

    <script src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.7.1/dist/leaflet.js"></script>
    <script>
        var map = L.map(''map'').setView([51.505, -0.09], 13);
        L.tileLayer(''https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png'', {
            attribution: ''© OpenStreetMap contributors''
        }).addTo(map);

        var marker;

        map.on(''click'', function(e) {
            if (marker) {
                map.removeLayer(marker);
            }
            marker = L.marker(e.latlng).addTo(map);
            document.getElementById(''location'').value = e.latlng.lat + '', '' + e.latlng.lng;
        });

        document.getElementById(''accidentForm'').addEventListener(''submit'', function(event) {
            event.preventDefault();
            var formData = new FormData(this);
            alert(''提交的数据: '' + JSON.stringify(Object.fromEntries(formData)));
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```

这个表单页面可以直接在浏览器中打开并使用。用户可以在地图上点击选择事故发生位置，并自动填充经纬度到表单中。表单还包括事故类型、事故发生时间、事故详情、事故上报人等字段，并且有一个提交按钮。提交时会弹出一个提示框显示提交的数据。', 'f', '2024-11-27 16:53:52.090447', 'admin', '2024-11-27 16:53:52.090447', 'admin');
INSERT INTO "chat_messages" ("id", "app_id", "conversation_id", "content", "is_user_message", "created_at", "created_by", "updated_at", "updated_by") VALUES (1861709023095689216, 1798176607609950208, '0iQvv4vg_ptsB9f7ol-h2', '请帮我写一个排队信息展示大屏，要求队列中的信息可以循环滚动，当鼠标移动到某一行数据上时，滚动停止；离开则滚动继续，以表格形式呈现', 't', '2024-11-27 17:49:54.644036', 'qinyuanpei', '2024-11-27 17:49:54.644036', 'qinyuanpei');
INSERT INTO "chat_messages" ("id", "app_id", "conversation_id", "content", "is_user_message", "created_at", "created_by", "updated_at", "updated_by") VALUES (1861709554543366144, 1798176607609950208, '0iQvv4vg_ptsB9f7ol-h2', '以下是实现排队信息展示大屏的完整代码：

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>排队信息展示大屏</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
        }
        .queue-container {
            width: 80%;
            max-width: 800px;
            overflow: hidden;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            background-color: #fff;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }
        table {
            width: 100%;
            border-collapse: collapse;
        }
        th, td {
            padding: 10px;
            text-align: left;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
        }
        th {
            background-color: #f2f2f2;
        }
        .scrollable-table {
            height: 300px;
            overflow-y: hidden;
        }
        .scrollable-table tbody {
            display: block;
            height: 100%;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }
        .scrollable-table thead, .scrollable-table tbody tr {
            display: table;
            width: 100%;
            table-layout: fixed;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="queue-container">
        <div class="scrollable-table">
            <table>
                <thead>
                    <tr>
                        <th>序号</th>
                        <th>姓名</th>
                        <th>队列位置</th>
                    </tr>
                </thead>
                <tbody id="queue-data">
                    <!-- Data will be inserted here -->
                </tbody>
            </table>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        const queueData = [
            { id: 1, name: ''张三'', position: 1 },
            { id: 2, name: ''李四'', position: 2 },
            { id: 3, name: ''王五'', position: 3 },
            { id: 4, name: ''赵六'', position: 4 },
            { id: 5, name: ''孙七'', position: 5 },
            { id: 6, name: ''周八'', position: 6 },
            { id: 7, name: ''吴九'', position: 7 },
            { id: 8, name: ''郑十'', position: 8 }
        ];

        const queueDataElement = document.getElementById(''queue-data'');
        let intervalId;

        function renderQueue() {
            queueDataElement.innerHTML = queueData.map(item => `
                <tr>
                    <td>${item.id}</td>
                    <td>${item.name}</td>
                    <td>${item.position}</td>
                </tr>
            `).join('''');
        }

        function startScrolling() {
            intervalId = setInterval(() => {
                const firstRow = queueDataElement.firstChild;
                queueDataElement.appendChild(firstRow);
            }, 2000);
        }

        function stopScrolling() {
            clearInterval(intervalId);
        }

        queueDataElement.addEventListener(''mouseenter'', stopScrolling);
        queueDataElement.addEventListener(''mouseleave'', startScrolling);

        renderQueue();
        startScrolling();
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```

这个代码实现了一个排队信息展示大屏，队列中的信息可以循环滚动，当鼠标移动到某一行数据上时，滚动停止；离开则滚动继续，以表格形式呈现。', 'f', '2024-11-27 17:52:01.350965', 'qinyuanpei', '2024-11-27 17:52:01.350965', 'qinyuanpei');
INSERT INTO "chat_messages" ("id", "app_id", "conversation_id", "content", "is_user_message", "created_at", "created_by", "updated_at", "updated_by") VALUES (1861710959115112448, 1798176607609950208, '0iQvv4vg_ptsB9f7ol-h2', '请帮我写一个聊天助手类的应用，要求可以输入消息，按回车发送，返回消息可以暂时先写死', 't', '2024-11-27 17:57:36.227743', 'qinyuanpei', '2024-11-27 17:57:36.227743', 'qinyuanpei');
INSERT INTO "chat_messages" ("id", "app_id", "conversation_id", "content", "is_user_message", "created_at", "created_by", "updated_at", "updated_by") VALUES (1861711336879296512, 1798176607609950208, '0iQvv4vg_ptsB9f7ol-h2', '以下是实现聊天助手类的应用的代码：

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>聊天助手</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
        }
        .chat-container {
            width: 300px;
            background-color: #fff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        .chat-box {
            height: 200px;
            padding: 10px;
            overflow-y: auto;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
        }
        .chat-input {
            display: flex;
            padding: 10px;
        }
        .chat-input input {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 4px;
            outline: none;
        }
        .chat-input input:focus {
            border-color: #007bff;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="chat-container">
        <div class="chat-box" id="chatBox"></div>
        <div class="chat-input">
            <input type="text" id="messageInput" placeholder="输入消息..." onkeypress="handleKeyPress(event)">
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        function handleKeyPress(event) {
            if (event.key === ''Enter'') {
                const message = document.getElementById(''messageInput'').value;
                if (message.trim() !== '''') {
                    const chatBox = document.getElementById(''chatBox'');
                    chatBox.innerHTML += `<p>你: ${message}</p>`;
                    chatBox.innerHTML += `<p>助手: 你好，我是聊天助手！</p>`;
                    document.getElementById(''messageInput'').value = '''';
                    chatBox.scrollTop = chatBox.scrollHeight;
                }
            }
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```

这个代码可以直接在浏览器中运行，用户可以输入消息并按回车发送，应用会返回“你好，我是聊天助手！”作为响应。', 'f', '2024-11-27 17:59:06.29303', 'qinyuanpei', '2024-11-27 17:59:06.29303', 'qinyuanpei');
INSERT INTO "chat_messages" ("id", "app_id", "conversation_id", "content", "is_user_message", "created_at", "created_by", "updated_at", "updated_by") VALUES (1861960573152006144, 1798176607609950208, '0iQvv4vg_ptsB9f7ol-h2', '请帮我整理一下艾伦图灵的生平资料，并谈谈你是如何看待这个人物的？', 't', '2024-11-28 10:29:28.820446', 'qinyuanpei', '2024-11-28 10:29:28.820446', 'qinyuanpei');
INSERT INTO "chat_messages" ("id", "app_id", "conversation_id", "content", "is_user_message", "created_at", "created_by", "updated_at", "updated_by") VALUES (1861960747765075968, 1798176607609950208, '0iQvv4vg_ptsB9f7ol-h2', '艾伦·麦席森·图灵（Alan Mathison Turing，1912年6月23日—1954年6月7日），英国数学家、逻辑学家，被誉为计算机科学之父和人工智能之父。他的主要贡献包括：

1. **图灵机**：提出了图灵机的概念，这是一种抽象的计算模型，奠定了计算机科学的基础。
2. **图灵测试**：提出了图灵测试，用于判断机器是否能够表现出与人类无法区分的智能行为。
3. **二战期间的密码破译**：在二战期间，图灵领导了布莱切利园的密码破译工作，成功破解了德国的恩尼格玛密码机，对盟军的胜利起到了关键作用。

图灵的生平充满了悲剧色彩。他在1952年被控以“严重猥亵”罪名，因为他与一名男子发生了同性恋关系，这在当时是非法的。尽管他在科学上的贡献巨大，但他被迫接受化学阉割治疗，最终在1954年自杀身亡。

**对艾伦·图灵的看法**：

艾伦·图灵是一位天才的数学家和逻辑学家，他的工作对计算机科学和人工智能的发展产生了深远的影响。他的图灵机和图灵测试仍然是计算机科学和人工智能领域的核心概念。尽管他的个人生活充满了痛苦和悲剧，但他的科学贡献将永远被铭记。图灵的故事也提醒我们，社会应该更加包容和尊重个人的多样性，不应该因为个人的性取向或其他非主流的生活方式而对其进行歧视和迫害。图灵的生平是对科学、人性和社会正义的深刻反思。', 'f', '2024-11-28 10:30:10.481996', 'qinyuanpei', '2024-11-28 10:30:10.481996', 'qinyuanpei');
INSERT INTO "chat_messages" ("id", "app_id", "conversation_id", "content", "is_user_message", "created_at", "created_by", "updated_at", "updated_by") VALUES (1861961029408395264, 1798176607609950208, '0iQvv4vg_ptsB9f7ol-h2', '你觉得本尼迪克特康巴布奇饰演的图灵怎么样', 't', '2024-11-28 10:31:17.63168', 'qinyuanpei', '2024-11-28 10:31:17.63168', 'qinyuanpei');
INSERT INTO "chat_messages" ("id", "app_id", "conversation_id", "content", "is_user_message", "created_at", "created_by", "updated_at", "updated_by") VALUES (1861961750354726912, 1798176607609950208, '0iQvv4vg_ptsB9f7ol-h2', '帮我写一个分享读书笔记或者摘抄的网站，用户可以使用 Markdown 输入内容并生成美观、拥有高级配色感的卡片，这些卡片可以导出为图片', 't', '2024-11-28 10:34:09.518461', 'qinyuanpei', '2024-11-28 10:34:09.518461', 'qinyuanpei');
