INSERT INTO "chat_messages" ("id", "app_id", "conversation_id", "content", "is_user_message", "created_at", "created_by", "updated_at", "updated_by") VALUES (1927624624812724224, 1798176607609950208, 'n1i0egtJQbc02RlZ39w-j', '# 图书馆访客量分析报告（2025-05-22至2025-05-28）

## 一、基础数据
| 日期   | 访客数量(人) | 趋势分析       |
|--------|-------------|----------------|
| 05-22  | 356         | 首日基准值     |
| 05-23  | 278         | 下降21.9%      |
| 05-24  | 412         | 单日峰值(+48%) |
| 05-25  | 189         | 周最低点       |
| 05-26  | 321         | 反弹69.8%      |
| 05-27  | 245         | 周末前回落     |
| 05-28  | 403         | 接近周峰值     |

## 二、可视化呈现
**ASCII动态折线图：**
```
450 ┤                                 ╭─╮
400 ┤                ╭─╮             │ │
350 ┤╭─╮             │ │             │ │
300 ┤│ │        ╭─╮  │ │    ╭─╮      │ │
250 ┤│ │        │ │  │ │    │ │      │ │
200 ┤│ │  ╭─╮   │ │  │ │    │ │  ╭─╮ │ │
150 ┤│ │  │ │   │ │  │ │    │ │  │ │ │ │
100 ┤│ │  │ │   │ │  │ │    │ │  │ │ │ │
    05-22 05-23 05-24 05-25 05-26 05-27 05-28
```

## 三、关键发现
1. **波动特征**：周内呈现"M"型双峰波动（05-24和05-28）
2. **极值对比**：最高值(412)是最低值(189)的2.18倍
3. **周末效应**：05-25（周日）访客量骤降至周最低
4. **恢复能力**：周一(05-26)快速回升至周均线(300±)上方

## 四、建议措施
1. 加强周末时段的服务资源配置
2. 针对周二/周五的访客高峰制定分流方案
3. 建立300人次的预警响应机制

（报告生成时间：2025-05-28 15:15）', 'f', '2025-05-28 15:14:58.745993', 'admin', '2025-05-28 15:19:39.146677', 'admin');
INSERT INTO "chat_messages" ("id", "app_id", "conversation_id", "content", "is_user_message", "created_at", "created_by", "updated_at", "updated_by") VALUES (1863408512567218176, 1798176607609950208, '0iQvv4vg_ptsB9f7ol-h2', '请帮我写一个聊天助手类的应用，要求可以输入消息，按回车发送，返回消息可以暂时先写死', 't', '2024-12-02 10:23:04.508964', 'admin', '2024-12-02 10:23:04.508964', 'admin');
INSERT INTO "chat_messages" ("id", "app_id", "conversation_id", "content", "is_user_message", "created_at", "created_by", "updated_at", "updated_by") VALUES (1863412098734886912, 1798176607609950208, '0iQvv4vg_ptsB9f7ol-h2', '我已经为您生成了一个简单的聊天助手应用的代码。用户可以在输入框中输入消息并按回车发送，应用会返回一条预设的消息。以下是完整的代码：

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>聊天助手</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
        }
        #chat-container {
            width: 300px;
            background-color: #fff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            padding: 20px;
        }
        #chat-box {
            height: 200px;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            border-radius: 4px;
            padding: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
            overflow-y: auto;
        }
        #message-input {
            width: 100%;
            padding: 10px;
            border: 1px solid #ccc;
            border-radius: 4px;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div id="chat-container">
        <div id="chat-box"></div>
        <input type="text" id="message-input" placeholder="输入消息并按回车发送">
    </div>

    <script>
        document.getElementById(''message-input'').addEventListener(''keypress'', function(e) {
            if (e.key === ''Enter'') {
                const message = this.value.trim();
                if (message) {
                    const chatBox = document.getElementById(''chat-box'');
                    chatBox.innerHTML += `<div>你: ${message}</div>`;
                    chatBox.innerHTML += `<div>助手: 这是预设的回复。</div>`;
                    this.value = '''';
                    chatBox.scrollTop = chatBox.scrollHeight;
                }
            }
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```

您可以将这段代码保存为一个HTML文件并在浏览器中打开，即可使用这个简单的聊天助手应用。', 'f', '2024-12-02 10:37:19.517394', 'admin', '2024-12-02 10:37:19.517394', 'admin');
INSERT INTO "chat_messages" ("id", "app_id", "conversation_id", "content", "is_user_message", "created_at", "created_by", "updated_at", "updated_by") VALUES (1863414481573515264, 1798176607609950208, '0iQvv4vg_ptsB9f7ol-h2', '我已经为您生成了一个简单的聊天助手应用的代码。用户可以在输入框中输入消息并按回车发送，服务器端会返回固定的消息“This is a fixed response from the server.”。以下是完整的代码：

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Chat Assistant</title>
    <style>
        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background-color: #f4f4f4;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            height: 100vh;
            margin: 0;
        }
        #chat-container {
            width: 400px;
            background-color: #fff;
            border-radius: 8px;
            box-shadow: 0 0 10px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        #chat-messages {
            height: 300px;
            padding: 10px;
            overflow-y: auto;
            border-bottom: 1px solid #ddd;
        }
        .message {
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }
        .message.user {
            text-align: right;
        }
        .message.server {
            text-align: left;
        }
        #chat-input {
            display: flex;
            padding: 10px;
        }
        #message-input {
            flex: 1;
            padding: 8px;
            border: 1px solid #ddd;
            border-radius: 4px;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div id="chat-container">
        <div id="chat-messages"></div>
        <div id="chat-input">
            <input type="text" id="message-input" placeholder="Type a message..." />
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        document.getElementById(''message-input'').addEventListener(''keypress'', function(e) {
            if (e.key === ''Enter'') {
                const message = this.value.trim();
                if (message) {
                    addMessage(message, ''user'');
                    this.value = '''';
                    setTimeout(() => {
                        addMessage(''This is a fixed response from the server.'', ''server'');
                    }, 500);
                }
            }
        });

        function addMessage(text, sender) {
            const messageDiv = document.createElement(''div'');
            messageDiv.className = `message ${sender}`;
            messageDiv.textContent = text;
            document.getElementById(''chat-messages'').appendChild(messageDiv);
            document.getElementById(''chat-messages'').scrollTop = document.getElementById(''chat-messages'').scrollHeight;
        }
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```

您可以将这段代码保存为一个HTML文件并在浏览器中打开，即可使用这个简单的聊天助手应用。', 'f', '2024-12-02 10:46:47.631732', 'admin', '2024-12-02 10:46:47.631732', 'admin');
