INSERT INTO "chat_messages" ("id", "app_id", "conversation_id", "content", "is_user_message", "created_at", "created_by", "updated_at", "updated_by") VALUES (1864960927196123136, 1798176607609950208, '0iQvv4vg_ptsB9f7ol-h2', '以下是一个简单的 Vue 组件示例，包含一个按钮，点击按钮时显示一个消息：

```vue
<template>
  <div>
    <button @click="showMessage">Click Me</button>
    <p v-if="messageVisible">{{ message }}</p>
  </div>
</template>

<script>
export default {
  data() {
    return {
      messageVisible: false,
      message: ''Hello, Vue!''
    };
  },
  methods: {
    showMessage() {
      this.messageVisible = true;
    }
  }
};
</script>

<style scoped>
button {
  margin-bottom: 10px;
}
</style>
```

这个组件包含一个按钮，点击按钮时会显示一条消息 "Hello, Vue!"。', 'f', '2024-12-06 17:11:48.99891', 'admin', '2024-12-06 17:11:48.99891', 'admin');
