INSERT INTO "chat_messages" ("id", "app_id", "conversation_id", "content", "is_user_message", "created_at", "created_by", "updated_at", "updated_by") VALUES (1930905247815962624, 1930872164936978432, '0hD54kfMEkxAV9dNbMWJj', '以下是整合后的HTML代码，包含所需的所有字段和功能：

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>事故上报表单</title>
  <!-- Tailwind CSS CDN -->
  <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script>
  <!-- Leaflet CSS -->
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css" integrity="sha256-xodZBNTC5n17Xt2atTPuE1HxjVMSvLVW9ocqUKLsCC0=" crossorigin=""/>
</head>
<body class="bg-gray-100 min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center">
  <div class="bg-white p-8 rounded shadow-md w-full max-w-lg">
    <h2 class="text-2xl font-bold mb-6 text-center">事故上报表单</h2>
    <form id="accidentForm" class="space-y-4">
      <div>
        <label for="location" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">事故发生位置（经纬度）</label>
        <input type="text" id="location" name="location" readonly class="mt-1 block w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md shadow-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-indigo-500 sm:text-sm" required/>
      </div>

      <div>
        <label for="type" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">事故类型</label>
        <select id="type" name="type" class="mt-1 block w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md shadow-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-indigo-500 sm:text-sm" required>
          <option value="">请选择</option>
          <option value="交通事故">交通事故</option>
          <option value="火灾事故">火灾事故</option>
          <option value="工伤事故">工伤事故</option>
          <option value="其他">其他</option>
        </select>
      </div>

      <div>
        <label for="time" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">事故发生时间</label>
        <input type="datetime-local" id="time" name="time" class="mt-1 block w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md shadow-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-indigo-500 sm:text-sm" required/>
      </div>

      <div>
        <label for="details" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">事故详情</label>
        <textarea id="details" name="details" rows="4" class="mt-1 block w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md shadow-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-indigo-500 sm:text-sm" required></textarea>
      </div>

      <div>
        <label for="reporter" class="block text-sm font-medium text-gray-700">事故上报人</label>
        <input type="text" id="reporter" name="reporter" class="mt-1 block w-full px-3 py-2 border border-gray-300 rounded-md shadow-sm focus:outline-none focus:ring-indigo-500 focus:border-indigo-500 sm:text-sm" required/>
      </div>

      <div id="map" class="w-full h-64 rounded-md"></div>

      <button type="submit" class="w-full bg-indigo-600 hover:bg-indigo-700 text-white font-semibold py-2 px-4 rounded-md focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-offset-2 focus:ring-indigo-500">
        提交
      </button>
    </form>
  </div>

  <!-- Leaflet JS -->
  <script src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js" integrity="sha256-o9N1j7kP6+HkldQxs+g7W+U7Z3w3kM4y0pHbZ0wHg3E=" crossorigin=""></script>
  <script>
    const form = document.getElementById(''accidentForm'');
    const locationInput = document.getElementById(''location'');

    // 初始化地图
    const map = L.map(''map'').setView([39.9042, 116.4074], 13); // 默认北京
    L.tileLayer(''https://{s}.tile.openstreetmap.org/{z}/{x}/{y}.png'', {
      attribution: ''&copy; OpenStreetMap contributors''
    }).addTo(map);

    let marker = null;

    map.on(''click'', function(e) {
      const { lat, lng } = e.latlng;
      locationInput.value = `${lat.toFixed(6)}, ${lng.toFixed(6)}`;
      if (marker) {
        map.removeLayer(marker);
      }
      marker = L.marker([lat, lng]).addTo(map);
    });

    form.addEventListener(''submit'', function(e) {
      e.preventDefault();
      const formData = new FormData(form);
      const data = Object.fromEntries(formData);
      alert(''表单提交成功！数据：\n'' + JSON.stringify(data, null, 2));
    });
  </script>
</body>
</html>
```

此表单具备以下特点：
- 使用 Tailwind CSS 样式，界面美观且具有响应式布局。
- 包含所需的字段：事故位置（通过点击地图获取经纬度）、事故类型、事故发生时间、事故详情及事故上报人。
- 集成了 Leaflet.js 开源地图以支持地理坐标的选择。

使用方法：
- 将上述代码保存为 `.html` 文件并在浏览器中打开即可查看和测试表单。
- 点击地图可以获取经纬度信息并自动填充到输入框。
- 提交表单后会弹出一个对话框展示用户填写的数据。', 'f', '2025-06-06 16:31:00.221379', 'admin', '2025-06-06 16:36:50.799377', 'admin');
