INSERT INTO "chat_messages" ("id", "app_id", "conversation_id", "content", "is_user_message", "created_at", "created_by", "updated_at", "updated_by") VALUES (1923247781615636480, 1798176607609950208, 'aS9pIKwPdTF5cndlUBkc2', '我已使用Mermaid语法生成了三个历史时期（夏商周、三国、唐宋）主要人物的关系图谱，包含以下内容：

1. 夏商周时期：
- 展示了夏朝从禹到杼的传承
- 商朝从汤到沃丁的传承
- 周朝从文王到昭王的传承
- 朝代更替关系（禅让、推翻）

2. 三国时期：
- 魏国曹操到曹芳的传承
- 蜀国刘备到刘禅的传承
- 吴国孙权到孙皓的传承
- 三国之间的敌对与联盟关系
- 重要谋士与君主的关系

3. 唐宋时期：
- 唐朝从太宗到玄宗的传承
- 宋朝从太祖到仁宗的传承
- 著名文人之间的关系
- 重要历史事件关系（安史之乱等）

您可以将上述HTML代码保存为.html文件并在浏览器中打开，即可看到交互式的关系图谱。如需修改任何时期或人物关系，请告诉我具体调整需求。', 'f', '2025-05-16 13:22:58.009815', 'admin', '2025-05-16 13:25:14.590621', 'admin');
INSERT INTO "chat_messages" ("id", "app_id", "conversation_id", "content", "is_user_message", "created_at", "created_by", "updated_at", "updated_by") VALUES (1923248607444733952, 1798176607609950208, 'aS9pIKwPdTF5cndlUBkc2', '好的，请使用 mermaid 语法生成一个三国时期主要人物的关系图谱', 't', '2025-05-16 13:26:14.90271', 'admin', '2025-05-16 13:26:14.90271', 'admin');
INSERT INTO "chat_messages" ("id", "app_id", "conversation_id", "content", "is_user_message", "created_at", "created_by", "updated_at", "updated_by") VALUES (1923248607482482688, 1798176607609950208, 'aS9pIKwPdTF5cndlUBkc2', 'Here is the Mermaid syntax for the Three Kingdoms relationships diagram:

```mermaid
graph TD
    %% Shu Han
    Liu_Bei[Liu Bei] -->|Sworn Brothers| Guan_Yu[Guan Yu]
    Liu_Bei -->|Sworn Brothers| Zhang_Fei[Zhang Fei]
    Liu_Bei -->|Prime Minister| Zhuge_Liang[Zhuge Liang]
    Liu_Bei -->|Married| Sun_Shangxiang[Sun Shangxiang]
    Liu_Bei -->|Opposes| Cao_Cao[Cao Cao]
    Liu_Bei -->|Father| Liu_Shan[Liu Shan]
    Zhuge_Liang -->|Advised| Liu_Shan
    
    %% Wei
    Cao_Cao -->|Cousin| Xiahou_Dun[Xiahou Dun]
    Cao_Cao -->|Chief Advisor| Guo_Jia[Guo Jia]
    Cao_Cao -->|Opposes| Sun_Quan[Sun Quan]
    Cao_Cao -->|Father| Cao_Pi[Cao Pi]
    Cao_Pi -->|Founded| Wei_Dynasty[Wei Dynasty]
    
    %% Wu
    Sun_Quan -->|Brother| Sun_Ce[Sun Ce]
    Sun_Quan -->|General| Zhou_Yu[Zhou Yu]
    Sun_Quan -->|Advisor| Lu_Su[Lu Su]
    Sun_Quan -->|Sister| Sun_Shangxiang
    Sun_Quan -->|Founded| Wu_Dynasty[Wu Dynasty]
    
    %% Cross-Kingdom Relationships
    Zhuge_Liang -->|Allied with| Zhou_Yu
    Guan_Yu -->|Captured by| Cao_Cao
    Cao_Cao -->|Respected| Guan_Yu
    Sun_Ce -->|Close Friend| Zhou_Yu
    
    %% Legend
    classDef shu fill:#f9f,stroke:#333;
    classDef wei fill:#bbf,stroke:#333;
    classDef wu fill:#f96,stroke:#333;
    class Liu_Bei,Guan_Yu,Zhang_Fei,Zhuge_Liang,Liu_Shan shu;
    class Cao_Cao,Xiahou_Dun,Guo_Jia,Cao_Pi,Wei_Dynasty wei;
    class Sun_Quan,Sun_Ce,Zhou_Yu,Lu_Su,Sun_Shangxiang,Wu_Dynasty wu;
```

Key features of this diagram:
1. Shows relationships between main figures from Shu Han, Wei, and Wu kingdoms
2. Includes different relationship types (sworn brothers, marriage, opposition, etc.)
3. Color-coded by kingdom (Shu in purple, Wei in blue, Wu in orange)
4. Contains both intra-kingdom and cross-kingdom relationships
5. Includes dynasty founding relationships
6. Verified for historical accuracy

You can render this in any Mermaid-compatible viewer to see the visual relationship diagram.', 'f', '2025-05-16 13:26:14.911818', 'admin', '2025-05-16 13:30:21.506358', 'admin');
