INSERT INTO "chat_messages" ("id", "app_id", "conversation_id", "content", "is_user_message", "created_at", "created_by", "updated_at", "updated_by") VALUES (1923285387472670720, 1798176607609950208, '0iQvv4vg_ptsB9f7ol-h2', '帮我写一个计数器组件，使用 Vue 实现，每点击一次，数量增加 1，初始数量为 0 ', 't', '2025-05-16 15:52:23.944599', 'admin', '2025-05-16 15:52:23.944599', 'admin');
INSERT INTO "chat_messages" ("id", "app_id", "conversation_id", "content", "is_user_message", "created_at", "created_by", "updated_at", "updated_by") VALUES (1923285387556556800, 1798176607609950208, '0iQvv4vg_ptsB9f7ol-h2', '以下是符合要求的Vue计数器组件代码，初始值为0，点击按钮时数量会增加1：

```html
<template>
  <div class="counter">
    <button @click="increment">Count: {{ count }}</button>
  </div>
</template>

<script>
export default {
  name: ''Counter'',
  data() {
    return {
      count: 0  // 初始值设为0
    }
  },
  methods: {
    increment() {
      this.count++  // 点击时数量增加1
    }
  }
}
</script>

<style scoped>
.counter {
  display: inline-block;
  margin: 10px;
}

button {
  padding: 8px 16px;
  font-size: 16px;
  cursor: pointer;
  background-color: #42b983;
  color: white;
  border: none;
  border-radius: 4px;
  transition: background-color 0.3s;
}

button:hover {
  background-color: #3aa876;
}
</style>
```

使用说明：
1. 这是一个完整的单文件Vue组件
2. 包含模板、脚本和样式三部分
3. 初始值count设置为0
4. 点击按钮会触发increment方法，使count值增加1
5. 按钮有基本的悬停效果样式

您可以直接复制这段代码到.vue文件中使用。', 'f', '2025-05-16 15:52:23.964516', 'admin', '2025-05-16 15:55:37.032993', 'admin');
